                            <comment id="497044" author="JIRAUSER21301" created="Mon, 29 Jun 2026 20:04:25 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=scherementsev&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;scherementsev&quot;&gt;scherementsev&lt;/a&gt;&#160; just FYI.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="500775" author="sergey" created="Wed, 2 Sep 2026 15:48:51 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;At first look, it is not easy to fix it as MDTs without QMT don&#8217;t know EDQUOT state. Probably, if there is no QMT, we could send a quota acquire request to the QMT like we don in DOM case. If there are no quotas for this project, return -EDQUOT. If acquire request succeeded, proceed rename and release granted space in the end.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="501698" author="gerrit" created="Thu, 17 Sep 2026 09:33:10 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&quot;Hongchao Zhang &amp;lt;hongchao@whamcloud.com&amp;gt;&quot; uploaded a new patch: &lt;a href=&quot;https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/69011&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/69011&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
